  <name>rille</name>
  <summary>DJ software for Linux</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.birkmann">
    <name>The rille contributors</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      rille is a native DJ application for Linux: four decks, remix decks, a
      mixer with FX, a music library and controller support, built around
      beatgrids that are detected precisely enough that sync never drifts.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Automatic beatgrids, key and loudness analysis</li>
      <li>Beat-locked sync that follows the beat you hear, with keylock</li>
      <li>Four track decks or remix decks with 64 sample cells each</li>
      <li>Two FX units, 3-band EQ, filter, auto-gain and a master limiter</li>
      <li>MIDI and HID controllers with LED feedback and MIDI learn</li>
      <li>PipeWire, JACK and ALSA; external mixer mode for hardware mixers</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
